WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.140
Professor, why do we let Luther do this?

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:10.519
Look at this place.

00:00:11.099 --> 00:00:13.120
He's done nothing but defile our holy ground.

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:15.759
History has taught us to walk among our enemies.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.539
Okay, while they walk all over us?

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.859
I understand your anger, Jeremiah.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.240
But we have no access to these caves without his permission.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.159
Professor Willowbrook, thank you for coming on such short notice.

00:00:35.259 --> 00:00:36.299
I, um...

00:00:36.299 --> 00:00:40.140
I didn't realize you'd be bringing someone with you, though.

00:00:41.179 --> 00:00:42.780
This is Jeremiah Olsclaw,

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.820
future leader of the Coache people

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:48.140
and one of my brightest graduate students.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.500
Oh, he may be able to help identify the artifact.

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:54.879
Jeremiah, it's an honor to meet you.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.679
Perhaps you could show us what you found.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.459
Yes, of course.

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:07.379
Miriam?

00:01:11.299 --> 00:01:13.659
What do you, uh...

00:01:13.659 --> 00:01:15.180
What do you make of this, Professor?

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.039
Incredible.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:20.519
Pollock.

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:24.060
Pollock?

00:01:25.079 --> 00:01:26.280
What is Pollock?

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.840
Ancient traditional cookware.

00:01:32.579 --> 00:01:33.060
Cookware?

00:01:34.359 --> 00:01:35.480
Beautiful example.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:37.920
Jeremiah?

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.439
What do you think it is?

00:01:39.620 --> 00:01:42.019
Uh, I think the professor is right.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:46.579
But I think we should take it back to the museum to properly study it.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:47.120
Oh, no.

00:01:47.319 --> 00:01:48.299
Can't leave the cave.

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.560
Not until I've had it thoroughly analyzed.

00:01:50.659 --> 00:01:50.900
