00:01:52.359 --> 00:01:52.700
What?

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:56.500
If you are the friend of the Coache that you claim to be,

00:01:57.319 --> 00:01:58.700
then why won't you let us take it now?

00:01:59.539 --> 00:01:59.859
Professor,

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:03.319
