gef

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.860
You need to make excuses, Naman.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.240
Don't worry.

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.540
Your secret is safe with me.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.699
I'm not Naman.

00:05:10.699 --> 00:05:13.439
It's just a story on a cave wall.

00:05:13.439 --> 00:05:17.220
Until last night, I believed that too.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.780
What happened last night?

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.020
Your destiny was revealed.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.819
It's called Pollock, the Starblade.

00:05:26.819 --> 00:05:29.280
It's been missing for 500 years.

00:05:29.279 --> 00:05:31.439
Until Lionel Luther unearthed it.

00:05:31.439 --> 00:05:33.079
It's supposed to shine a light on the true Sigeith

00:05:33.079 --> 00:05:35.919
so Naman can identify and destroy his greatest enemy.

00:05:35.919 --> 00:05:38.719
And Willenberg came to you because he thinks you're Naman.

00:05:38.719 --> 00:05:40.559
I mean, Dad, you should have seen the way he looked at me.

00:05:40.559 --> 00:05:43.399
It was kind of overwhelming.

00:05:43.399 --> 00:05:46.299
Clark, he thinks you're the savior of his people.

00:05:46.299 --> 00:05:49.000
That's a lot to shoulder, even for you.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.279
Yeah, but I'm not.

00:05:50.279 --> 00:05:51.899
I mean, I can barely take care of myself.

00:05:51.899 --> 00:05:53.659
I see now.

00:05:53.659 --> 00:05:57.839
You can't allow yourself to get all tied up in prophecies

00:05:57.839 --> 00:05:59.279
written on a cave wall.

00:05:59.279 --> 00:06:02.879
Except some of the prophecies are starting to come true.

00:06:02.879 --> 00:06:04.059
What?

00:06:04.059 --> 00:06:06.259
One of Willenberg's students somehow got a hold of the blade

00:06:06.259 --> 00:06:07.839
and has given him powers.

00:06:07.839 --> 00:06:09.979
What exactly are we talking about here, Clark?

00:06:09.979 --> 00:06:13.399
So far, strength, speed, and he's bulletproof.

00:06:13.399 --> 00:06:15.179
How is that possible?

00:06:15.179 --> 00:06:17.559
The Quatchi were charged with the blade's safekeeping.

00:06:17.559 --> 00:06:18.599
If one of them is holding it, they're

00:06:18.599 --> 00:06:20.599
given the power to protect it until they can

00:06:20.599 --> 00:06:23.939
deliver it to the true Naman.

00:06:23.939 --> 00:06:28.399
Clark, I had your abilities only for a short time.

00:06:28.399 --> 00:06:29.279
But believe me. having all of them, I'm going to have to do it.

00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:31.599
Well, that power was very intoxicating.

00:06:31.599 --> 00:06:34.819
You don't think Jemai is going to give it back?

00:06:34.819 --> 00:06:37.139
No.

00:06:37.139 --> 00:06:38.919
Clark, you're going to find him and stop him before Lionel

00:06:38.919 --> 00:06:39.799
Luther gets a hold of it.

00:06:44.399 --> 00:06:45.419
Why won't you listen to me?

00:06:45.419 --> 00:06:48.000
I told you I don't want to talk about it.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.559
Note to self, forward all telemarketing calls to Pete.

00:06:51.559 --> 00:06:54.179
You want to tell me what that was about?

00:06:54.179 --> 00:06:56.359
It was nothing.

00:06:56.359 --> 00:06:57.519
Did you pull an all-nighter?

00:06:57.519 --> 00:06:58.059
Or do you just find changing clothes every day a little too much?

00:06:58.059 --> 00:06:58.279
No.

00:06:58.279 --> 00:06:58.479
I'm not.

00:06:58.479 --> 00:06:58.759
I'm not.

00:06:58.759 --> 00:06:58.779
I'm not.

00:06:58.779 --> 00:06:58.859
I'm not.

00:06:58.859 --> 00:06:58.939
I'm not.

00:06:58.939 --> 00:06:58.979
I'm not.

00:06:58.979 --> 00:06:59.000
I'm not.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:06:59.099
I'm not.

